When cooking polenta use one part polenta to three or four parts water, depending on how thick You like it.

Add @salt{} and @butter{80%g} to the water, bring it to boil and then slowly stir in @polenta (cornmeal){200%g}.

Simmer polenta for ~{2-3%minutes} and keep on stirring.

When the polenta is ready add @jarred Truffles and mushrooms{80%g}, a few drops of @Black truffle olive oil{} and mix it all together.

> Once opened consume within seven days.